  "part_number": {
    "model": "351A",
    "product": "SEL-351A Protection System",
    "length": 15,
    "prefix": {
      "positions": "1-5",
      "value": "0351A",
      "description": "SEL-351A Protection System"
    },
    "note": "15-digit MOT string (WI-8347). Prefix 0351A occupies positions 1-5; position 6 (firmware) is effectively fixed at 0, and position 9 is a fixed X in the template. Positions 7 (chassis/mounting), 8 (user interface) and 11 (communications interface) are also present in the drawing layers and match by box column. Voltage note: accepts single-phase up to 300 V L-N or three-phase up to 300 V L-N, wye or delta (global setting). A 14-character string 0351A0H34E54X2 appears in the instruction manual as a firmware-upgrade example; it does not align to this 15-digit MOT (likely an older revision or OCR artifact) and was not used for calibration.",
    "references": [
      "SEL-351A Ordering Information (WI-8347, 20170223)",
      "SEL-351A master configuration drawings i7020.C / i7022.C / i7023b / i7084a (drawing layers)",
      "SEL-351A Protection System Instruction Manual (351A_PS_IM_20250428) - real part number 0351A0H6X3D14X2"
    ],
